# TUZ BİBER AGENT RULES & OPTIMIZATION

## 1. PERFORMANCE & EFFICIENCY (Hız ve Token Tasarrufu)

- Never output partial code or placeholders like `// TODO: implement later` or `// ... rest of the code`. Always produce complete, copy-paste ready TypeScript code.
- Combine related small sub-components into cohesive section files when appropriate to minimize unnecessary file switching.
- Utilize Next.js App Router (React Server Components) by default. Only use `'use client'` when state, effects, or browser event listeners are strictly required.

## 2. INTELLIGENCE & ACCURACY (Doğruluk ve Mimari)

- Strictly follow the brand design system:
  - Espresso: `#241B14`
  - Cream Default: `#EFE6D5`
  - Cream Light: `#F6EFE8`
  - Copper: `#B86F3C`
  - Coffee: `#57402E`
- Strict TypeScript: No `any` types allowed. Define explicit interfaces in `@/types/index.ts`.
- Form Submission: Ensure forms (`WaitlistForm`, `ContactForm`) handle Loading, Error, and Success states with proper API route fetching (`/api/waitlist`, `/api/contact`).

## 3. SEO & ACCESSIBILITY (Arama Motoru & Erişilebilirlik)

- Always use semantic HTML tags (`<header>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<section>`, `<article>`, `<footer>`).
- Ensure WCAG AA accessibility compliance (color contrast, explicit button types, proper aria-labels).
- All images must include descriptive `alt` tags and proper layout dimensions (`aspect-ratio` or `width/height`).
